/*
 * Deluge Workflow for RFQ_Inquiries
 * Application: JollyRx Internal Plant Vault
 * 
 * Event 1: Form Workflows -> RFQ_Inquiries -> Created -> Before Submit (on validate)
 * Event 2: Form Workflows -> RFQ_Inquiries -> Created -> After Submit (on success)
 */

// --------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 1. ON VALIDATE (Ensures Target Quantity meets the Plant's configured MOQ)
// --------------------------------------------------------------------------
/*
